This crate is a vendored copy of syn_derive 0.2.0 (https://github.com/Kyuuhachi/syn_derive), included in halyard
(https://github.com/cgorski/halyard) so that the framework does not depend on
the unmaintained proc-macro-error2 crate. The original authors' copyright and
licence are retained (see the LICENSE file(s) in this directory); the only
changes are the package name, the removal of proc-macro-error2 in favour of
syn::Error diagnostics, and the dependency paths.
